                                                "example_id": "473193ef-608b-4339-9f46-a2ec7a2cfd44",
                                                "sense_id": "0d398c78-0afc-38b0-93e5-359628d80e1a",
                                                "text": "But when the blow comes down in the fulness of expectation; when the bough is smitten while green, and the flower cut down in its spring; when the young and lovely perish, while the eyes, full of light, were fixed on the future,—then, indeed, is the visitation heavy to bear."
                                            }
                                        ]
